{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge, Fight, and Flourish!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Forgedale</strong>, an immersive RPG where farming meets adventure! Build your homestead, battle formidable bosses, complete epic quests, mine for rare resources, and craft powerful gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action-Packed Combat</strong>\u00a0: Face off against challenging bosses and monsters in dynamic battles. Wield powerful weapons and magic to defeat your opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565700/extras/acf48b055ebb5527608ab1f728bef5ce.avif?t=1759497662\" width=766 height=247 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Farming System</strong>\u00a0: Grow crops, raise animals, and manage your land to thrive in this ever-changing world.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565700/extras/9c660d838f11b3a0b60e13cd53310687.avif?t=1759497662\" width=893 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine &amp; Craft</strong>\u00a0: Discover rare ores, gather resources, and craft legendary weapons, armor, and tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565700/extras/2785d4511f0be26503cc8b688de580c8.avif?t=1759497662\" width=992 height=299 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expansive Quests &amp; Exploration</strong>\u00a0: Embark on thrilling quests, uncover hidden secrets, and explore diverse biomes teeming with adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565700/extras/85038096f05290dddc357e144f330cdd.avif?t=1759497662\" width=1560 height=895 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression &amp; Customization</strong>\u00a0: Level up your character, unlock abilities, and tailor your playstyle to become the ultimate adventurer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565700/extras/f47e25e3838df0c5a811be81eb2eea79.avif?t=1759497662\" width=1238 height=1244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to farm, fight, and forge your destiny?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3565700?t=1759497662","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3565700?t=1759497662","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565700/0f55f1f42fe5a21e298054a2b6e6ca9c8ae43e78/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759497662","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565700/0f55f1f42fe5a21e298054a2b6e6ca9c8ae43e78/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759497662","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge, Fight, and Flourish!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Forgedale</strong>, an immersive RPG where farming meets adventure! Build your homestead, battle formidable bosses, complete epic quests, mine for rare resources, and craft powerful gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action-Packed Combat</strong>\u00a0: Face off against challenging bosses and monsters in dynamic battles. Wield powerful weapons an